in front of your mistress.

00:04:38.987 --> 00:04:40.614
You can do it
in front of your spouse,

00:04:40.697 --> 00:04:41.782
but not your mistress.

00:04:42.741 --> 00:04:43.784
That's weird.

00:04:43.867 --> 00:04:45.577
That's just a dumb rule.
That's not a thing.

00:04:45.661 --> 00:04:46.745
Yeah.

00:04:46.828 --> 00:04:48.539
Just flirt, you know?

00:04:48.622 --> 00:04:49.540
Yeah. Flirting,

00:04:49.623 --> 00:04:52.251
that's like part of
the French constitution.

00:04:53.293 --> 00:04:54.586
This steak
isn't cooked at all.

00:04:56.296 --> 00:04:57.714
Pardon, monsieur?

00:04:58.215 --> 00:04:59.216
It should be bloody.

00:04:59.299 --> 00:05:00.717
-I mean rare.
-Order it blue.

00:05:02.052 --> 00:05:03.303
That's the way we do it.

00:05:03.929 --> 00:05:05.681
