order the ris de veau.

00:05:05.764 --> 00:05:07.266
Ris de veau so good, though.

00:05:07.349 --> 00:05:08.642
Oh, it's perfect, yes.

00:05:08.725 --> 00:05:11.520
Think it's brains or balls,
but it tastes like ass.

00:05:11.603 --> 00:05:13.021
No,
it doesn't taste like ass.

00:05:13.105 --> 00:05:14.940
Come on.
Customer is always right.

00:05:15.023 --> 00:05:16.900
Customer
is never right in Paris.

00:05:16.984 --> 00:05:19.778
