like they do in the US.

00:05:26.243 --> 00:05:28.078
-'Cause we have labour laws.
-Exactly.

00:05:28.161 --> 00:05:31.498
And you won't get salmonella
if you eat raw meat.

00:05:31.582 --> 00:05:33.208
-No.
-'Cause our meat is good.

00:05:33.292 --> 00:05:35.586
