do not sue us.

00:05:37.629 --> 00:05:40.924
It's always nice.
Never rains in this Paris.

00:05:41.008 --> 00:05:42.176
Paris is so pretty.

00:05:42.259 --> 00:05:44.845
Makes me wanna live there.
And I already do.

00:05:44.928 --> 00:05:48.682
She's the woman who thinks
