00:06:16.668 --> 00:06:17.586
Yeah, exactly.

00:06:18.337 --> 00:06:19.463
-That's very accurate.
-Yeah.

00:06:19.546 --> 00:06:20.672
French cars will kill you.

00:06:20.756 --> 00:06:22.549
But French men
