00:06:48.158 --> 00:06:50.994
- Un Intercité.
- Un Intercité.

00:06:51.078 --> 00:06:52.996
I want her to know
the real struggle

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.082
-of moving around France.
-Yeah.

00:06:55.165 --> 00:06:56.834
