00:07:17.688 --> 00:07:18.689
so...

00:07:20.148 --> 00:07:22.234
-Not this one.
-Check the itinerary.

00:07:22.734 --> 00:07:25.654
I love her look.
Camille's look.

00:07:26.446 --> 00:07:27.781
Yeah. I want that jacket.

00:07:27.865 --> 00:07:29.324
