00:07:43.922 --> 00:07:45.340
Also, we don't call them
dame pipi.

00:07:45.424 --> 00:07:46.466
That's very rude.

00:07:46.550 --> 00:07:49.094
-Yeah. Literally means...
-Call her "the nice lady".

00:07:49.178 --> 00:07:50.179
...lady peepee.

00:07:51.513 --> 00:07:53.265
That's it for now.
Thanks for watching.

00:07:53.348 --> 00:07:56.101
